      "type": "text",
      "title": "Oracle is not instrumented into this Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 51
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "No series in this Prometheus carries `site=\"oracle\"`, and there is no Oracle job in `observability/prometheus-config.yaml`. Oracle runs its own Prometheus, configured by `observability/oracle-prometheus-config.yaml`; it is neither federated nor remote-written here.\n\n**So: this dashboard cannot say whether Oracle is up.** The ORACLE stat above counts Oracle targets, so it stops saying NOT INSTRUMENTED the moment federation or remote-write is added \u2014 no dashboard edit needed."
      }
